Comment: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:56.08,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,タバコが染みた服臭い
Comment: 0,0:21:56.08,0:21:58.42,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,夜が終わってもまだ
Comment: 0,0:21:58.42,0:22:00.84,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,どこにも行けない帰さないで
Comment: 0,0:22:00.84,0:22:02.21,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,Don't leave me
Comment: 0,0:22:02.59,0:22:06.30,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,Do this, we can do this
